try"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-1-badge-legend" value="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-1-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Read Terraform&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;The tool reads the client&amp;#x27;s .tf files. It needs no AWS access, no state and no plan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="548" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-2-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="86" width="600" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-2-badge-legend" value="2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-2-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Assume the review role&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;With the external id agreed with the client, it assumes a role holding AWS&amp;#x27;s read-only SecurityAudit policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="548" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-3-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="172" width="600" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-3-badge-legend" value="3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-3-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Read configuration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Describe, Get and List calls across IAM, S3, EC2, RDS, CloudTrail, CloudWatch Logs, DynamoDB and Lambda. A refused call is listed as not checked.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="548" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-4-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="258" width="600" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-4-badge-legend" value="4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-4-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Apply the rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;24 rules turn configuration into findings, each with its file and line or resource and region, and the best practice it relates to.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="548" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-5-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="344" width="600" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-5-badge-legend" value="5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-5-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Write the summary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;explain.py builds the plain summary from the rules, or asks the model for one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="548" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-6-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="430" width="600" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-6-badge-legend" value="6" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-6-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Check the model&#x27;s text&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Nova Lite sees only the findings. Its summary is rejected if it cites a finding that doesn&amp;#x27;t exist or a number that isn&amp;#x27;t in them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="548" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-7-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="516" width="600" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-7-badge-legend" value="7" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-7-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-7-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Build the report&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Most severe first, with accepted findings and anything not checked listed separately.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-7-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="548" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-8-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="602" width="600" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-8-badge-legend" value="8" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-8-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-8-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hand over&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Markdown for the manager, JSON for tools, and an exit code that can fail a CI build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-8-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="548" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-9-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="688" width="600" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-9-badge-legend" value="9" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-9-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step-9-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;CI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;GitHub Actions runs the tests and reviews the tool&amp;#x27;s own Terraform on every push.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-9-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="548" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend-aux-note" value="&lt;i&gt;Nothing in the client&#x27;s account is changed: every call the review makes was checked against the SecurityAudit policy. The rules find the problems; the model only writes the summary. Grey boxes hold third-party technology, shown with its own logo.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#D4D4D4);fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry x="0" y="800" width="600" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
